          "filename": "Howmore Hostel - geograph.org.uk - 1342415.jpg",
          "caption": "Howmore Hostel. This is one of the hostels run by the Gatliffe Trust, and affiliated to the Scottish Youth Hostels Association. It uses this converted traditional cottage, which now contains the sleeping accommodation, and a more recent cottage next door which contains cooking and eating facilities. The original cottage is a white house because although it is in the form of a black house it has windows and chimneys, which let light in and smoke out. Compare this view with 200636, taken 39 years earlier.",
